		(uuid "2a6a1b73-da08-45b0-9eab-087d203f85a4")
	)
	(text "L1 and L4 have a direct return paths through solid ground plane on \nL2 and L3. But Pwr on L1 is perhaps an issue in terms of EMC ?"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.574 130.048 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3f25b049-bf76-4be8-b846-c73b84ac5f27")
	)
	(text "7628 FR DK = 4.4\n\nSo 0.35mm trace width => 49.98 ohms\nFor USB differentials pairs, 0.35mm trace width and 0.35mm spacing => 90.25 ohms (90 ohms +/- 10% for USB)\n\nCalculation according PCB way impedance calculator :\n( https://www.pcbway.com/pcb_prototype/impedance_calculator.html )"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 79.756 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8dc94855-9777-48c0-8ec4-75fe1e1673a1")
	)
